    <Paragraph Type="Character">
      <Text>DETECTIVE REYES</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue">
      <Text>Sit down. Eat something. We have to talk about the money, and about your brother. It is tonight. Nobody. Not yet. But that won't last, and you know it won't.</Text>
